    "en": {
      "trackName": "Color Sort Fun - Puzzle Game",
      "description": "Sort colors in different tubes (water sort) in this fun puzzle game for watch and phone.\n\nFeatures:\n- Entertaining puzzle game\n- Infinite levels\n- Play offline \n- More games inside you can unlock\n- Available for watch, tablet and phone\n\nHow to play:\nSort the colors! Click on a tube to pick up the ball on top and click on another tube to drop it there. \nYou can only drop it on an empty tube or on a tube with a ball of the same color on top. In case you can't solve one level with the available tubes, you can create another empty tube.",
      "releaseNotes": "More content added",
